{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/760540-limb-from-limb-monster-from-the-deep-etc","id":760540,"title":"Limb from Limb, Monster From the Deep, etc","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-07T23:56:04-08:00","id":760540,"title":"Limb from Limb, Monster From the Deep, etc","content":"A quick question for these Atavisms and any other abilities that add a weapon modifier to unarmed damage:<br /> <br /> 1) Does it stack? Would a Beast with both Atavisms and a Lair of 2 at Low Satiety have unarmed attacks rated at 4L?<br /> 2) If not, does the user simply choose which they want to utilize if they have both?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-08T07:09:57-08:00","id":760649,"title":"","content":"The intent seems to be that they wouldn't stack. The powers both revolve around gaining a weapon modifier to your unarmed attack. Neither suggest anything about increasing the weapon modifier to your attacks. <br /> <br /> Generally speaking, whenever you have two modifers (magical or mundane) of the same type, the larger one dominates, while the second one sits there and does nothing (more of a backup than anything, in event the larger number goes away for some reason). So, in this case, we'd have the larger value deal the damage. That said, if you really wanted to deal the lower damage, I don't think any ST is going to say no to that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-09T09:41:24-08:00","id":761555,"title":"","content":"1) With how they are written, they would not stack.<br /> 2) Yes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1157-soulgambit","name":"SoulGambit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"912"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-09T10:13:13-08:00","id":761575,"title":"","content":"Why wouldn't they stack?<br /> You want to build a combat monster? Build a combat monster. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Hige sceal \u00fe\u0113 heardra, heorte \u00fe\u0113 c\u0113nre,<br /> m\u014dd sceal \u00fe\u0113 m\u0101re, \u00fe\u0113 \u016bre m\u00e6gen lytla\u00f0.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8950-vithrir","name":"Vithrir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8950_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}